  "reverse": "拼音也有“不能硬拼”的地方：zhi chi shi ri zi ci si yi wu yu 等是整体认读音节；j q x y 后面的 u 是 ü；iu、ui、un 是 iou、uei、uen 的省写；“一”“不”在词里会变调。这些在“规则外”里单独练。", "reverseEn": "Pinyin also has places where you cannot simply blend: zhi chi shi ri zi ci si yi wu yu and a few others are whole-syllable readings (整体认读音节); u after j q x y is ü; iu, ui, un are short spellings of iou, uei, uen; 一 and 不 change tone inside words. These are practised separately under “Irregular words”."
